            {
              "id": "nyc-ll144.candidate-notice",
              "name": "NycLl144CandidateNotice",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Ten business days notice to candidates"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "6 RCNY § 5-304 and NYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b): notify New York City resident candidates at least ten business days before use of the tool, and include instructions for how to request an alternative selection process or a reasonable accommodation, if available."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "6 RCNY § 5-304 and NYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b): notify New York City resident candidates at least ten business days before use of the tool, and include instructions for how to request an alternative selection process or a reasonable accommodation, if available.\n\nNotify NYC-resident candidates at least ten business days before the tool is used, via the employment section of the website, the job posting, or mail/email. Each missing notice is a separate violation.\n\nNYC Local Law 144 § 5-304 — Notice to candidates and employees: https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page\nNYC Local Law 144 § 20-871(b) — Notice requirements: https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page",
                "markdown": "**Ten business days notice to candidates**\n6 RCNY § 5-304 and NYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b): notify New York City resident candidates at least ten business days before use of the tool, and include instructions for how to request an alternative selection process or a reasonable accommodation, if available.\n**How to close it:** Notify NYC-resident candidates at least ten business days before the tool is used, via the employment section of the website, the job posting, or mail/email. Each missing notice is a separate violation.\n**Citations**\n- [NYC Local Law 144 § 5-304 — Notice to candidates and employees](https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page)\n- [NYC Local Law 144 § 20-871(b) — Notice requirements](https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page)\n_In force from 2023-07-05._"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
