            {
              "id": "nyc-ll144.data-policy",
              "name": "NycLl144DataPolicy",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Publish the data retention policy and data sources"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "NYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b)(3): publish on the employment section of the website the tool's data retention policy, the type of data collected and the source of the data, with instructions for making a written request for that information, and respond within thirty days."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "NYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b)(3): publish on the employment section of the website the tool's data retention policy, the type of data collected and the source of the data, with instructions for making a written request for that information, and respond within thirty days.\n\nPublish the retention policy, data types and data sources, plus instructions for a written request, and answer such requests within thirty days.\n\nNYC Local Law 144 § 20-871(b)(3) — Data retention policy disclosure: https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page",
                "markdown": "**Publish the data retention policy and data sources**\nNYC Admin. Code § 20-871(b)(3): publish on the employment section of the website the tool's data retention policy, the type of data collected and the source of the data, with instructions for making a written request for that information, and respond within thirty days.\n**How to close it:** Publish the retention policy, data types and data sources, plus instructions for a written request, and answer such requests within thirty days.\n**Citations**\n- [NYC Local Law 144 § 20-871(b)(3) — Data retention policy disclosure](https://www.nyc.gov/site/dca/about/automated-employment-decision-tools.page)\n_In force from 2023-07-05._"
              },
